ir circulation was deactivated. To validate the model, we used the \nfollowing values in the model based upon the test conditions: \n\u2022\nMSG working volume (Ref. 1) = 0.255 m3\n\u2022\nBASS\u2013II hardware = ~0.005 m3\n\u2022\nNet volume V = ~0.25 m3", "metadata": {"source": "BASS-II Summary Report.pdf", "page": 123}}